        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn MT5BI, Adobe Iron Single Cylinder Lockset With Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIron entrysets are good for adding a touch of old world beauty to your home without dating it; so a unique handleset like this is perfect for new and historic homes. Because of its rough black finish, the Adobe Iron Single Cylinder Handleset With Lever has a rustic feel that will add texture to your doors. For doors 1-3/4\" thick with 2-3/4\" backsets. A single cylinder handleset, the deadbolt is operated by key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior; while the latchbolt underneath the deadbolt is operated by a turn knob from the interior and a thumbpiece from the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ACO-Mortise-Specifications.gif?v=1704354518\" width=\"255\" height=\"273\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Acorn Mortise Lock Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/dummy-adobe-iron-handleset-with-lever-acorn-mt5bl\"><b>Dummy Adobe Iron Handleset With Lever</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Adobe Iron Dummy Handleset With Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handleset Length: 11-1/4”</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handleset Width: 3-3/8”</li>\r\n<li>Interior Lever Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Finish Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> A key operates the deadbolt from the exterior while a thumbturn operates it from the interior. The latch is operated by a lever from the interior and by a thumbpiece from the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe handing actually refers to the mortise lock, rather than the lever. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Adobe Iron Single Cylinder Handleset With Lever, Acorn MT5BI",
                "description": "Adobe Iron Single Cylinder Lockset With Lever Acorn MT5BI - Iron entrysets are good for adding a touch of old world beauty to your home without dating it; so a unique handleset like this is perfect for new and historic homes. Because of its rough black finish, the Adobe Iron Single Cylinder Handleset With Lever has a rustic feel that will add texture to your doors. For doors 1-3/4 inches thick with 2-3/4 inch backsets. A single cylinder handleset, the deadbolt is operated by key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior; while the latchbolt underneath the deadbolt is operated by a turn knob from the interior and a thumbpiece from the exterior.",
